"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-09T15:51:33-07:00","id":1459480,"title":"","content":"Then something changed since the Kickstarter. We were told then, by the book's developers, that TR was book 5. If it isn't, then there <i>is</i> no book 5.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-09T16:17:57-07:00","id":1459481,"title":"","content":"Ahh. Thanks a ton then for helping me figure that out! Much love!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27053-bmobius","name":"bmobius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-10T01:22:36-07:00","id":1459521,"title":"","content":"Also some passed discussion of this <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1384894-roman-numerals\">here</a>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26145-babi_gog","name":"babi_gog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26145_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"94"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-11T22:28:22-07:00","id":1459724,"title":"","content":"Satyr shared this insight on FB about a week back regarding this:<br /> <br /> &quot;Back when Gods &amp; Monsters was being written, I hadn't known that The Mage Cookbook was going to be in the small format. It was supposed to have been book V. Thus, I had written the BoF spine-text as VI. I never got a cover-proof for BoF, so it went to press with the wrong number on it. I made a note to change the Technocracy: Reloaded spine number to V, but that was not done.&quot;<br /> <br /> So yeah, Technocracy Reloaded is now Book VII. We may never get a Book V, just as we never got a Book 22 first time around <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2543-thebian","name":"Thebian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2543_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-21T20:51:04-07:00","id":1464823,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Thebian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1459472-m20-book-v?p=1459724#post1459724\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Satyr shared this insight on FB about a week back regarding this:<br /> <br /> &quot;Back when Gods &amp; Monsters was being written, I hadn't known that The Mage Cookbook was going to be in the small format. It was supposed to have been book V. Thus, I had written the BoF spine-text as VI. I never got a cover-proof for BoF, so it went to press with the wrong number on it. I made a note to change the Technocracy: Reloaded spine number to V, but that was not done.&quot;<br /> <br /> So yeah, Technocracy Reloaded is now Book VII. We may never get a Book V, just as we never got a Book 22 first time around <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>That was incredibly helpful! Thank you! Ah well, lol.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27053-bmobius","name":"bmobius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}